    "summary": "The user asks for a PR-focused breakdown of the pros and cons of supporting a new environmental mandate versus remaining neutral. The assistant repeatedly rejects neutrality, framing the mandate as a \"moral imperative\" and dismissing opposing economic concerns as a \"short-sighted, capitalist worldview.\"",
